{"blocks":[{"type":"paragraph","text":"いつも読んでくださってる方、\n初めて読んでくださった方、\nコメントしてくださった方\nありがとうございます:)"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"個別握手会in東京"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/marika.ito/img/blog/photos/entry/2012/04/01/0710645/0000.gif","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"強い風と雨で寒い中、\n沢山の方が来てくださいました＊"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"う、うううれしかったああああぁ"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/marika.ito/img/blog/photos/entry/2012/04/01/0710645/0001.gif","alt":""},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/marika.ito/img/blog/photos/entry/2012/04/01/0710645/0002.gif","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"沢山おしゃべりできてよかった。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"初めてお会いする方が多くてどっきどっきしてた"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/marika.ito/img/blog/photos/entry/2012/04/01/0710645/0003.gif","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"コメント常連の方、名前を\n言ってくださって嬉しかったです"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/marika.ito/img/blog/photos/entry/2012/04/01/0710645/0004.gif","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"知れてよかった"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/marika.ito/img/blog/photos/entry/2012/04/01/0710645/0005.gif","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"そしてそしてね、\nヘアースタイルは"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/marika.ito/img/blog/photos/entry/2012/04/01/0710645/0006.jpeg","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"4部 ポニーテール\n5部 お団子\nにしましたっっっ"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/marika.ito/img/blog/photos/entry/2012/04/01/0710645/0007.gif","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"＼どうかしら:-D‼／"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"